  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Velocity&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>157</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
